{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf11 Welcome to the dark world of the <strong>Neon Knight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Knight</strong> is a 2D action side-scroller for Windows PC. Step into the epic tale of a supernatural warrior, resurrected to wander through a dystopian kingdom torn apart by fear and oppression. His mission: to end the reign of terror and uncover the fate of his lost family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its fast-paced combat, haunting atmosphere, and a story full of twists, Neon Knight blends the spirit of classic 2D games with modern action mechanics and cinematic storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*Intense, fast-paced combat</strong> that keeps you on edge</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*A narrative full of reversals</strong> and emotional stakes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*Atmospheric locations and memorable characters</strong> to discover</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*Stylized monochrome visuals</strong> that define its unique dark aesthetic</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*Immersive single-player journey</strong> through a dystopian world</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*Survive Mode</strong> for those who crave endless challenge</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/790210?t=1768741934","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/790210?t=1768741934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/790210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768741934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/790210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768741934","categ